.Dd @NCOLLECTD_DATE@
.Dt NCOLLECTD-ZONEINFO 5
.Os ncollectd @NCOLLECTD_VERSION@
.Sh NAME
.Nm ncollectd-zoneinfo
.Nd Documentation of ncollectd's zoneinfo plugin
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal -compact
\fBload-plugin\fP zoneinfo
\fBplugin\fP zoneinfo
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The \fBzoneinfo\fP plugin collectd information about memory zones reading
the file \fI/proc/zoneinfo\fP.
.Pp
The metrics have the \fInode\fP and \fIzone\fP labels.
Since Linux 4.8 some statistics are kept per NUMA node and are shown in the
\fIper-node stats\fP section of the first populated zone of each node.
These metrics only have the \fInode\fP label.
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr ncollectd 1 ,
.Xr ncollectd.conf 5
